			Summons a Baby Crystal Slime, Bouncy Slime, and Heavenly Slime.
			Each uses 1/3 of a minion slot, and deal 1/3 of the weapon's damage.
			The slimes will ram into targets, with the Crystal Slime releasing a barrage of lingering crystal shots and the Bouncy Slime shooting bouncing gel balls at the target as it travels.
			'''
		DisplayName: Gel Cane
	}

